{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Evidovan\u00ed uch\u00e1dza\u010di o zamestnanie","update":"2026-05-29","note":"Zdroj \u00fadajov:\n\u00darad pr\u00e1ce, soci\u00e1lnych vec\u00ed a rodiny\n....\nPo\u010det evidovan\u00fdch uch\u00e1dza\u010dov o zamestnanie spolu - evidovan\u00fd uch\u00e1dza\u010d o zamestnanie je ob\u010dan, ktor\u00fd m\u00f4\u017ee pracova\u0165, chce pracova\u0165 a h\u013ead\u00e1 zamestnanie a je veden\u00fd v evidencii uch\u00e1dza\u010dov o zamestnanie pr\u00edslu\u0161n\u00e9ho \u00daradu pr\u00e1ce. (389\/2006 Z.z. Z\u00e1kon o slu\u017eb\u00e1ch zamestnanosti a o zmene a doplnen\u00ed niektor\u00fdch z\u00e1konov).\nPo\u010det evidovan\u00fdch uch\u00e1dza\u010diek o zamestnanie - z po\u010dtu evidovan\u00fdch uch\u00e1dza\u010dov o zamestnanie sa uved\u00fa \u017eeny. Nepatria sem \u017eeny na materskej dovolenke do 3 rokov veku die\u0165a\u0165a. (389\/2006 Z.z. Z\u00e1kon o slu\u017eb\u00e1ch zamestnanosti a o zmene a doplnen\u00ed niektor\u00fdch z\u00e1konov).\n","href":"http:\/\/datacube.statistics.sk\/#!\/view\/sk\/VBD_SK_WIN\/pr5001rr\/v_pr5001rr_00_00_00_sk","id":["nuts15","pr5001rr_rok","pr5001rr_ukaz","pr5001rr_data"],"size":[1,30,2,1],"role":{"time":["pr5001rr_rok"],"geo":["nuts15"],"metric":["pr5001rr_data"]},"dimension":{"nuts15":{"label":"nuts15","note":"0 SR + Oblasti + Kraje + Okresy + Obce","category":{"index":{"SK031B517402":0},"label":{"SK031B517402":"\u017dilina"}}},"pr5001rr_rok":{"label":"pr5001rr_rok","note":"Rok","category":{"index":{"2025":0,"2024":1,"2023":2,"2022":3,"2021":4,"2020":5,"2019":6,"2018":7,"2017":8,"2016":9,"2015":10,"2014":11,"2013":12,"2012":13,"2011":14,"2010":15,"2009":16,"2008":17,"2007":18,"2006":19,"2005":20,"2004":21,"2003":22,"2002":23,"2001":24,"2000":25,"1999":26,"1998":27,"1997":28,"1996":29}}},"pr5001rr_ukaz":{"label":"pr5001rr_ukaz","note":"Ukazovate\u013e","category":{"index":{"U15061":0,"U15062":1},"label":{"U15061":"Po\u010det evidovan\u00fdch uch\u00e1dza\u010dov o za